  "goodToKnow": "Der Beweggrund is the motive that drives someone to act, literally the reason that moves (bewegt) you. It sounds a bit formal: aus welchem Beweggrund? In criminal law, niedrige Beweggründe (base motives) are one of the features that can turn a killing into murder (Mord). In everyday speech people more often say Motiv or Grund. Plural: die Beweggründe."
